VATE&s=a1fd8e693006e8e7a4a0260ec0e115c5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@arigatao_o/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b2ecfd2/uploads/origins/9908be2f-1494-4e70-85a4-49a6534bbbc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b75112a5cc3d1a77d4884d38f5ad7f82", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b2ecfd2/uploads/origins/9908be2f-1494-4e70-85a4-49a6534bbbc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b75112a5cc3d1a77d4884d38f5ad7f82, https://si.imgix.net/8b2ecfd2/uploads/origins/9908be2f-1494-4e70-85a4-49a6534bbbc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=120e09e86e7a3aeee878e4b6cd8072c9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b2ecfd2/uploads/origins/9908be2f-1494-4e70-85a4-49a6534bbbc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c255f8bd4393382ed0dfcf011e0d5ca1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I was wondering if you could draw my cats, I am trying to get the photo printed and hung up in my home :) Thank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/TAfS6RJ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@arigatao_o/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/168bc434/uploads/origins/094f5e80-d8ce-4fbf-8bef-1a781c7bf657?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=499adb59526016b654dc31504d3a6cfc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/168bc434/uploads/origins/094f5e80-d8ce-4fbf-8bef-1a781c7bf657?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=499adb59526016b654dc31504d3a6cfc, https://si.imgix.net/168bc434/uploads/origins/094f5e80-d8ce-4fbf-8bef-1a781c7bf657?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5900622faec45e10a84ad146832f4a43 2x, https://si.imgix.net/168bc434/uploads/origins/094f5e80-d8ce-4fbf-8bef-1a781c7bf657?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80c1f4abff54c8129b432730937709c2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\nご多忙中申し訳ありませんが、もし宜ければ個人観賞用のOCカップルのイラストをお願いしたいと思います。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-wgQhwOWWF0oBSsGRareIH6aIKVvfrQP?usp=sharing   \n\n【リクエスト】\n可能であれば、2人の動物化イラストをお願いしたいと思います。\nピンク髪の子=犬、黄色い髪の子=狐みたいな感じをお願いします。(狐は犬よりサイズが大きいと思います)\n\n迷惑をかけたら、気軽にキャンセルしてください。\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/21wsg1sj32gv?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@arigatao_o/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a865e8a/uploads/origins/8617fdee-4738-47bf-9301-e19335fbf7d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=588bae33ae14836ce84b5d9dec1d307f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2a865e8a/uploads/origins/8617fdee-4738-47bf-9301-e19335fbf7d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=588bae33ae14836ce84b5d9dec1d307f, https://si.imgix.net/2a865e8a/uploads/origins/8617fdee-4738-47bf-9301-e19335fbf7d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c36a0743fc075e14e56c61f3d0c560cc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2a865e8a/uploads/origins/8617fdee-4738-47bf-9301-e19335fbf7d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da718dbcd263bb57be256e59d3b0d608 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI would like to request a drawing for my friend. \nMy friend really liked your work you did here (https://skeb.jp/@arigatao_o/works/6), and wanted to have a similar drawing for his character!\nCould you draw a hedgehog in a knight armor eating some muffins or a cupcake? The setting would be in a medieval/fantasy world.\nI would like the hedgehog to have a happy and excited expression, similar to the image in the reference URL.\n\nThe finished piece would be used for streaming so if it's possible, can you make the drawing in a resolution of 16:9?\n\nThank you for your consideration. ♥\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ml8oQC8fVIH_0eeROzuSyRns8VB-c1ix?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@arigatao_o/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d9ef445/uploads/origins/402fcbf2-3818-4868-9dd0-fb0b94645a73?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78656041f89b0783edd88bd3b37a2caf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d9ef445/uploads/origins/402fcbf2-3818-4868-9dd0-fb0b94645a73?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78656041f89b0783edd88bd3b37a2caf, https://si.imgix.net/1d9ef445/uploads/origins/402fcbf2-3818-4868-9dd0-fb0b94645a73?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61ba01c96c89ae6defe43e180ee02cde 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d9ef445/uploads/origins/402fcbf2-3818-4868-9dd0-fb0b94645a73?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57ab67623999d5777ba958a45e48a45d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI'm in love with the cute animals you draw, and I'd like to make a request.\n\nWhat I would like you to draw is a black shiba and a cream-colored rabbit having a picnic.\nI'd like the black bush and the rabbit to be about the same size, or the rabbit could be a little bigger if it doesn't look out of place.\nThe food that gatao draws always looks delicious, so I'd be happy if he could include something.\n\nThe original images of the animals are Ryota and Seishiro from the following URL...\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/83591659\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/90959354\n\nWe hope you will consider it.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@arigatao_o/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9889cad6/uploads/origins/8e5512b1-241f-4002-be16-842e36a76e61?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=647c5d73c09504074b29bed8