art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello master gatao! Nice to meet you! This is my very first time requesting a skeb. I really enjoy viewing your beautiful pet portraits. I have two dogs I love dearly - Latte (white shepherd mix) and Mocha (brown german shepherd). \nPlease refer to this photo album for references: ( https://photos.app.goo.gl/4tpstvQpJ8sCdetUA )\n\nLatte is a cheerful, playful, little-sister type. She has pink and black cow-patterned paws.\nMocha is a very strict and serious older sister. She has black paws.\n\nI would like to request a drawing of my 2 dogs having a tea party, or maybe having yakiniku together. \nAny colors, composition, foods that you think would be fitting I would be very happy with. \n\nIf possible, I would like the file in PSD as well. \n\nI understand that you have a busy schedule, so thank you very much for considering my request!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@arigatao_o/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f45b833/uploads/origins/9b5bfb8e-c308-4f8d-b230-e94ddf970c40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db8ce1010b1b4d0c1ce0c589e7e5d815", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f45b833/uploads/origins/9b5bfb8e-c308-4f8d-b230-e94ddf970c40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db8ce1010b1b4d0c1ce0c589e7e5d815, https://si.imgix.net/2f45b833/uploads/origins/9b5bfb8e-c308-4f8d-b230-e94ddf970c40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=96cbc5c7ebf6b7c7acacb3a324248aee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f45b833/uploads/origins/9b5bfb8e-c308-4f8d-b230-e94ddf970c40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4004a1c936088bf612afd103b5e224d4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "gatao様こんにちは。\nいつも素敵なイラスト拝見しております。\nリクエストできる機会を設けていただけて、大変嬉しい思いです。\n\n以下、リクエストさせていただきたい内容です。\n●布おばけのイラスト\n\n幅広く曖昧なリクエストで恐れ入ります。\ngataoさんの表現される色彩や構図がどれも大好きなため、\n布おばけというモチーフをgataoさんの解釈で描いていただ